  "$comment": "Dark palette presets shared by every client. Each client asserts its palette instances equal `palettes`, derives tokens with `derived`, and resolves the stored preference with `resolveCases`. Light mode is out of scope and unchanged. `custom` is the 8th dark palette, derived from a user seed color by the derivation steps in `custom.derivationCases`; every client must reproduce `custom.derivationCases` (each channel may differ by at most 1 because of libm rounding). It is not in `order` so ends that do not know it yet keep treating \"custom\" as an unknown id.",
