  "custom": {
    "id": "custom",
    "name": "Custom",
    "storageField": "darkPaletteCustom",
    "$storageField": "preference field holding the user's seed color as #RRGGBB (uppercase); presence = the user picked a color",
    "defaultSeed": "#60A5FA",
    "presets": [
      "#FF8A65",
      "#FB923C",
      "#FBBF24",
      "#A3E635",
      "#4ADE80",
      "#2DD4BF",
      "#22D3EE",
      "#60A5FA",
      "#818CF8",
      "#C084FC",
      "#F472B6",
      "#FB7185"
    ],
    "hueSlider": {
      "lightness": 0.78,
      "chroma": 0.14,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 359,
      "$comment": "slider value h (integer degrees) → seed = fromOklch(lightness, chroma, h)"
    },
    "derivation": {
      "$steps": [
        "1. [L0, C0, H] = OKLCH(seed); C = max(C0, minChroma).",
        "2. Surface and text family: for each key in familyChroma, L = OKLCH(palettes[ladderFrom][key]).L; color = fromOklch(L, familyChroma[key], H).",
        "3. primary: base = clamp(L0, primaryLightness); if base == L0 primary = seed else fromOklch(base, C, H). While min contrast on contrastRules.surfaces < minSecondaryOnSurfaces and base + lightenStep*i <= maxLightness: pL = base + lightenStep*i, primary = fromOklch(pL, C, H).",
        "4. accent: aBase = min(accent.maxLightness, pL + accent.lightnessDelta), chroma C*accent.chromaScale, hue (H + accent.hueShift) mod 360; lighten by lightenStep the same way until it passes on the surfaces.",
        "5. primaryHover = fromOklch(min(hover.maxLightness, pL + hover.lightnessDelta), C*hover.chromaScale, H); primaryActive = fromOklch(pL - active.lightnessDelta, C, H).",
        "6. onPrimary = fromOklch(onPrimary.startLightness - lightenStep*i, min(C, onPrimary.maxChroma), H) for i = 0, 1, ... until it reaches minOnPrimary on primary, accent, primaryHover and primaryActive, or the lightness would drop below onPrimary.minLightness.",
        "7. If onPrimary on primaryActive is still below minOnPrimary, raise primaryActive by lightenStep (not above pL) until it passes.",
        "8. adjusted = 'lightened' / 'darkened' when |pL - L0| > adjustedNoticeDelta, else null (drives the one-line notice under the picker).",
        "fromOklch(L, C, H): OKLab → linear sRGB; if any channel is outside [-1e-4, 1+1e-4], retry with C - gamutStep*i; clamp, gamma-encode, round to #RRGGBB.",
        "Derived tokens (primarySubtle, glow, gradient, aurora, …) then follow `derived` like every preset; glowK = derivation.glowK; status colors are shared."
      ],
      "ladderFrom": "dark",
      "familyChroma": {
        "bg": 0.014,
        "bgSubtle": 0.015,
        "bgInset": 0.016,
        "surface": 0.017,
        "surfaceRaised": 0.02,
        "text": 0.008,
        "textSecondary": 0.02,
        "textTertiary": 0.02,
        "codeBg": 0.012,
        "codeHeaderBg": 0.016
      },
      "minChroma": 0.04,
      "primaryLightness": [
        0.72,
        0.88
      ],
      "maxLightness": 0.96,
      "lightenStep": 0.01,
      "accent": {
        "hueShift": 35,
        "lightnessDelta": 0.05,
        "chromaScale": 0.9,
        "maxLightness": 0.9
      },
      "hover": {
        "lightnessDelta": 0.07,
        "chromaScale": 0.8,
        "maxLightness": 0.94
      },
      "active": {
        "lightnessDelta": 0.08
      },
      "onPrimary": {
        "startLightness": 0.22,
        "minLightness": 0.08,
        "maxChroma": 0.06
      },
      "gamutStep": 0.004,
      "adjustedNoticeDelta": 0.02,
      "glowK": 1
    },
